            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CaperWest"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've made this a couple of times - it's on my list of favourite comfort foods! Best way to eat hot dogs :) I add sauerkraut, and when I didn't have bread, have sliced potatoes &amp; baked them (35 min at 400) and then topped with the filling &amp; baked 10 min more at 350.",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-28T15:31:14.570Z"
          },
