            },
            "reviewBody": "These are the best Hotdogs I’ve ever eaten… that being said I prefer my dogs cooked more not just hot so I boiled them a bit to plump them up… I also always make my buns like garlic bread ❤️",
            "datePublished": "2024-06-27T04:11:19.770Z"
