            "reviewBody": "I lined the entire pan with aluminum foil and then covered over the hot dogs with foil, too. This seemed to help keep the hot dogs buns softer. You might want or need to tent the covering sheet of aluminum foil to keep it from sticking to the cheese while cooking.",
